{"seq":4,"slug":"stream-processing","title":"流处理框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/distributed-systems/messaging-and-streaming/stream-processing","wordCount":1328,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"流处理框架\">流处理框架</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>流处理（Stream Processing）是对无界数据流进行连续、实时的计算。与批处理不同，流处理在数据到达时立即处理，延迟通常在毫秒到秒级。Apache Flink 和 Kafka Streams 是当前最主流的流处理框架，它们在语义保证、状态管理和窗口计算等方面各有特色。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>流处理要回答&quot;无界数据如何做有界聚合&quot;，四个概念是它的支点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>有界 vs 无界</strong>：批处理面对有界数据集（一次完整结果、可重跑容错），流处理面对无界数据流（持续更新的结果、靠 Checkpoint 容错）。</li>\n<li><strong>时间语义</strong>：事件时间（事件实际发生，最准但需处理乱序）、处理时间（系统处理时刻，最简单但不确定）、摄入时间（进入系统时刻，折中）。</li>\n<li><strong>Watermark</strong>：告诉系统&quot;不会再有时间戳小于 W 的事件到来&quot;，是事件时间语义下触发窗口计算、并定义迟到数据如何处理的机制。</li>\n<li><strong>窗口与状态</strong>：窗口（滚动/滑动/会话/全局）把无界流切成可聚合的有限片段；状态（算子、键控、广播）则承载跨事件的记忆，是容错的核心对象。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>主线：<strong>流处理的一切复杂性都源于&quot;无界&quot;——因为数据无界，所以需要窗口来定义聚合边界、需要 Watermark 来在乱序中推进时间、需要状态与 Checkpoint 来保证故障后结果不重不丢。</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"批处理-vs-流处理\">批处理 vs 流处理</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>批处理</th>\n<th>流处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据集</td>\n<td>有界（固定大小）</td>\n<td>无界（持续到达）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟</td>\n<td>分钟到小时</td>\n<td>毫秒到秒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>处理方式</td>\n<td>全量处理后输出</td>\n<td>逐条或微批处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结果</td>\n<td>一次完整结果</td>\n<td>持续更新的结果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>容错</td>\n<td>重新运行作业</td>\n<td>Checkpoint + 恢复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代表</td>\n<td>MapReduce、Spark</td>\n<td>Flink、Kafka Streams</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  subgraph 批处理&#10;    D1[数据集] --&gt; P1[批量计算] --&gt; R1[结果]&#10;  end&#10;  subgraph 流处理&#10;    D2[数据流...] --&gt; P2[连续计算] --&gt; R2[持续输出...]&#10;  end\">graph LR\n  subgraph 批处理\n    D1[数据集] --&gt; P1[批量计算] --&gt; R1[结果]\n  end\n  subgraph 流处理\n    D2[数据流...] --&gt; P2[连续计算] --&gt; R2[持续输出...]\n  end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"apache-flink\">Apache Flink</h2><h3 id=\"架构\">架构</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  C[Client] --&gt;|提交作业| JM[JobManager]&#10;  JM --&gt;|调度任务| TM1[TaskManager 1]&#10;  JM --&gt;|调度任务| TM2[TaskManager 2]&#10;  TM1 --&gt;|Checkpoint| S[State Backend]&#10;  TM2 --&gt;|Checkpoint| S\">graph TD\n  C[Client] --&gt;|提交作业| JM[JobManager]\n  JM --&gt;|调度任务| TM1[TaskManager 1]\n  JM --&gt;|调度任务| TM2[TaskManager 2]\n  TM1 --&gt;|Checkpoint| S[State Backend]\n  TM2 --&gt;|Checkpoint| S</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>JobManager</td>\n<td>作业调度、Checkpoint 协调</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TaskManager</td>\n<td>执行具体的算子任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>State Backend</td>\n<td>状态存储（内存/RocksDB/文件系统）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"编程模型\">编程模型</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from pyflink.datastream import StreamExecutionEnvironment&#10;from pyflink.common import WatermarkStrategy&#10;&#10;env = StreamExecutionEnvironment.get_execution_environment()&#10;&#10;orders = env.from_source(&#10;    kafka_source,&#10;    WatermarkStrategy.for_monotonous_timestamps(),&#10;    &quot;orders&quot;&#10;)&#10;&#10;revenue_per_minute = (&#10;    orders&#10;    .key_by(lambda order: order.category)&#10;    .window(TumblingEventTimeWindows.of(Time.minutes(1)))&#10;    .reduce(lambda a, b: a.amount + b.amount)&#10;)&#10;&#10;revenue_per_minute.sink_to(output_sink)&#10;env.execute(&quot;Revenue Calculator&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pyflink.datastream </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> StreamExecutionEnvironment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pyflink.common </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> WatermarkStrategy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">env </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> StreamExecutionEnvironment.get_execution_environment()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">orders </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> env.from_source(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    kafka_source,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    WatermarkStrategy.for_monotonous_timestamps(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"orders\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">revenue_per_minute </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .key_by(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">lambda</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order: order.category)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .window(TumblingEventTimeWindows.of(Time.minutes(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .reduce(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">lambda</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a, b: a.amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b.amount)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">revenue_per_minute.sink_to(output_sink)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">env.execute(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Revenue Calculator\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"kafka-streams\">Kafka Streams</h2><p>Kafka Streams 是 Kafka 内置的轻量级流处理库，无需独立集群：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  K[Kafka Topic] --&gt; KS[Kafka Streams App]&#10;  KS --&gt; K2[Kafka Output Topic]&#10;  KS --&gt; ST[State Store&lt;br/&gt;RocksDB]\">graph LR\n  K[Kafka Topic] --&gt; KS[Kafka Streams App]\n  KS --&gt; K2[Kafka Output Topic]\n  KS --&gt; ST[State Store&lt;br/&gt;RocksDB]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比</th>\n<th>Flink</th>\n<th>Kafka Streams</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>部署模式</td>\n<td>独立集群</td>\n<td>嵌入应用进程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>依赖</td>\n<td>独立系统</td>\n<td>仅依赖 Kafka</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表达能力</td>\n<td>强（CEP、ML 等）</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运维成本</td>\n<td>较高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Exactly-Once</td>\n<td>Checkpoint</td>\n<td>Kafka 事务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>复杂流处理</td>\n<td>Kafka 生态内简单转换</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"StreamsBuilder builder = new StreamsBuilder();&#10;&#10;KStream&lt;String, Order&gt; orders = builder.stream(&quot;orders&quot;);&#10;&#10;KTable&lt;Windowed&lt;String&gt;, Long&gt; counts = orders&#10;    .groupByKey()&#10;    .windowedBy(TimeWindows.ofSizeWithNoGrace(Duration.ofMinutes(5)))&#10;    .count();&#10;&#10;counts.toStream().to(&quot;order-counts&quot;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">StreamsBuilder builder </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> StreamsBuilder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">KStream&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> orders </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> builder.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"orders\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">KTable&#x3C;Windowed&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Long</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> counts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">groupByKey</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">windowedBy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(TimeWindows.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ofSizeWithNoGrace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Duration.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ofMinutes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">counts.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toStream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">to</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order-counts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"窗口-window\">窗口（Window）</h2><p>流处理中对无界数据进行有界聚合的核心机制：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  subgraph 滚动窗口&#10;    W1[&quot;[0, 5min)&quot;] --&gt; W2[&quot;[5, 10min)&quot;] --&gt; W3[&quot;[10, 15min)&quot;]&#10;  end&#10;  subgraph 滑动窗口&#10;    S1[&quot;[0, 10min)&quot;]&#10;    S2[&quot;[5, 15min)&quot;]&#10;    S3[&quot;[10, 20min)&quot;]&#10;  end&#10;  subgraph 会话窗口&#10;    SS1[&quot;session gap&quot;] --&gt; SS2[[活动期间]&quot;]&#10;  end\">graph TD\n  subgraph 滚动窗口\n    W1[\"[0, 5min)\"] --&gt; W2[\"[5, 10min)\"] --&gt; W3[\"[10, 15min)\"]\n  end\n  subgraph 滑动窗口\n    S1[\"[0, 10min)\"]\n    S2[\"[5, 15min)\"]\n    S3[\"[10, 20min)\"]\n  end\n  subgraph 会话窗口\n    SS1[\"session gap\"] --&gt; SS2[[活动期间]\"]\n  end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>窗口类型</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>滚动窗口</td>\n<td>固定大小，不重叠</td>\n<td>每分钟统计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滑动窗口</td>\n<td>固定大小，有重叠</td>\n<td>滑动平均值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>会话窗口</td>\n<td>按活动间隔划分</td>\n<td>用户会话分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全局窗口</td>\n<td>一个窗口，自定义触发器</td>\n<td>自定义聚合逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"时间语义\">时间语义</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时间类型</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>事件时间</td>\n<td>事件实际发生的时间</td>\n<td>最准确，需处理乱序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>处理时间</td>\n<td>系统处理事件的时间</td>\n<td>最简单，但不确定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>摄入时间</td>\n<td>事件进入系统的时间</td>\n<td>折中方案</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"watermark-水位线\">Watermark（水位线）</h3><p>Watermark 告诉系统&quot;不会再有时间戳小于 W 的事件到来&quot;：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  E1[&quot;Event t=1&quot;] --&gt; E2[&quot;Event t=3&quot;]&#10;  E2 --&gt; W[&quot;Watermark W=2&quot;]&#10;  W --&gt; E3[&quot;Event t=5&quot;]&#10;  E3 --&gt; E4[&quot;Event t=4 (迟到)&quot;]&#10;  E4 --&gt; W2[&quot;Watermark W=4&quot;]\">graph LR\n  E1[\"Event t=1\"] --&gt; E2[\"Event t=3\"]\n  E2 --&gt; W[\"Watermark W=2\"]\n  W --&gt; E3[\"Event t=5\"]\n  E3 --&gt; E4[\"Event t=4 (迟到)\"]\n  E4 --&gt; W2[\"Watermark W=4\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>处理策略</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>丢弃迟到</td>\n<td>超过 Watermark 的事件丢弃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>允许迟到</td>\n<td>设置允许迟到窗口（allowed lateness）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>侧输出</td>\n<td>迟到事件输出到侧流单独处理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"状态管理\">状态管理</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态类型</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>算子状态</td>\n<td>绑定到算子实例</td>\n<td>数据源偏移量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>键控状态</td>\n<td>按 key 分区的状态</td>\n<td>每用户计数器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>广播状态</td>\n<td>所有算子实例共享</td>\n<td>规则/配置</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"checkpoint-容错\">Checkpoint 容错</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;  participant JM as JobManager&#10;  participant TM1 as TaskManager 1&#10;  participant TM2 as TaskManager 2&#10;  participant FS as State Backend&#10;&#10;  JM-&gt;&gt;TM1: Checkpoint Barrier&#10;  JM-&gt;&gt;TM2: Checkpoint Barrier&#10;  TM1-&gt;&gt;FS: 快照算子状态&#10;  TM2-&gt;&gt;FS: 快照算子状态&#10;  TM1--&gt;&gt;JM: Checkpoint ACK&#10;  TM2--&gt;&gt;JM: Checkpoint ACK&#10;  Note over JM: Checkpoint 完成\">sequenceDiagram\n  participant JM as JobManager\n  participant TM1 as TaskManager 1\n  participant TM2 as TaskManager 2\n  participant FS as State Backend\n\n  JM-&gt;&gt;TM1: Checkpoint Barrier\n  JM-&gt;&gt;TM2: Checkpoint Barrier\n  TM1-&gt;&gt;FS: 快照算子状态\n  TM2-&gt;&gt;FS: 快照算子状态\n  TM1--&gt;&gt;JM: Checkpoint ACK\n  TM2--&gt;&gt;JM: Checkpoint ACK\n  Note over JM: Checkpoint 完成</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>性能开销</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>At-Least-Once</td>\n<td>Checkpoint，重放未确认消息</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Exactly-Once</td>\n<td>Checkpoint + 两阶段提交</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"典型应用场景\">典型应用场景</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>技术选型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>实时 ETL</td>\n<td>数据清洗和转换</td>\n<td>Flink / Kafka Streams</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实时聚合</td>\n<td>实时指标统计</td>\n<td>Flink</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CEP</td>\n<td>复杂事件模式匹配</td>\n<td>Flink CEP</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实时风控</td>\n<td>交易异常检测</td>\n<td>Flink</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据同步</td>\n<td>CDC 数据库变更捕获</td>\n<td>Flink CDC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实时推荐</td>\n<td>用户行为实时特征计算</td>\n<td>Flink / Spark</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><ul>\n<li>优先使用事件时间（Event Time）+ Watermark，保证结果的确定性</li>\n<li>Flink 适合复杂流处理场景，Kafka Streams 适合 Kafka 生态内的轻量转换</li>\n<li>Checkpoint 间隔根据延迟容忍度设置（通常 1-5 分钟）</li>\n<li>大状态使用 RocksDB State Backend，避免内存溢出</li>\n<li>监控背压（Backpressure），及时调整并行度</li>\n<li>迟到数据使用侧输出收集，后续批量修正</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>流处理面对的是无界数据流，其复杂度几乎全部源自&quot;无界&quot;这一前提：用窗口把无界流切成可聚合的有限片段，用事件时间 + Watermark 在乱序中可靠地推进时间并触发计算，用状态与 Checkpoint 保证故障后结果不重不丢（Exactly-Once 靠两阶段提交）。框架选型上，Flink 适合复杂流处理（CEP、CDC、大状态用 RocksDB），Kafka Streams 适合 Kafka 生态内的轻量转换。工程要点是：优先事件时间保证结果确定性、Checkpoint 间隔按延迟容忍度设置、监控背压及时调整并行度，并让迟到数据走侧输出后续修正。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"流处理框架","id":"流处理框架"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"批处理 vs 流处理","id":"批处理-vs-流处理"},{"level":2,"text":"Apache Flink","id":"apache-flink"},{"level":3,"text":"架构","id":"架构"},{"level":3,"text":"编程模型","id":"编程模型"},{"level":2,"text":"Kafka Streams","id":"kafka-streams"},{"level":2,"text":"窗口（Window）","id":"窗口-window"},{"level":2,"text":"时间语义","id":"时间语义"},{"level":3,"text":"Watermark（水位线）","id":"watermark-水位线"},{"level":2,"text":"状态管理","id":"状态管理"},{"level":3,"text":"Checkpoint 容错","id":"checkpoint-容错"},{"level":2,"text":"典型应用场景","id":"典型应用场景"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"事件驱动架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/distributed-systems/messaging-and-streaming/event-driven"},"next":null}